# The Thing, Ben Grimm: "Trample. Whenever one or more Heroes you control deal damage to a player, put two +1/+1 counters on The Thing."
# The Thing (a Hero, 7/7) attacks on turn 3 and deals 7 to Bot2 (20 to 13): he gets two counters (9/9), not more. On turn 4 Bot2's Agent
# of Atlas (a Hero, but not one Bot1 controls) hits Bot1 for 2: nothing. On turn 5 only Bot1's Grizzly Bears (not a Hero) attack and deal 2
# (13 to 11): nothing. On turn 7 Bot1's Reptil, Dinomorpher (a Hero) deals just 1 (11 to 10): two more counters (11/11).

